  "body": "_See the [release notes](https://github.com/chrisgurney/obsidian-note-toolbar/blob/master/src/Help/Releases/en/1.35.md) for all of the changes in this release._\r\n\r\nIf you find this plugin useful, [consider donating ↗](https://buymeacoffee.com/cheznine). Thank you! ❤️\r\n\r\n## Improvements 🚀\r\n\r\n- Toolbar previews are now shown in all toolbar suggest modals, including when using _Copy item to toolbar..._ and _Move item to toolbar..._\r\n\r\n## Fixes 🛠️\r\n\r\n- Corrupted local storage values were throwing uncaught SyntaxError on note load, in some cases. [#632](https://github.com/chrisgurney/obsidian-note-toolbar/issues/632) _Thanks Fazal!_\r\n- Settings: Items: Hotkey button is no longer shown for certain item types (separators, etc.).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/chrisgurney/obsidian-note-toolbar/compare/1.35.14...1.35.16",
